<br>  <br>  #hyperprior<br>  theta ~ dunif(1, 100)<br>})<br><br><br><br>modelConsts &lt;- list(L = nrow(dat))<br><br>modelData &lt;- list(x = dat$Notifications)<br><br># initsList &lt;- list(lambda = abs(rnorm(nrow(dat), mean(dat$Notifications), sd(dat$Notifications))))<br><br><br>model &lt;- nimbleModel(modelCode, data = modelData,  constants = modelConsts) #inits = initsList,<br>#====================================================================<br># Compile and run model<br>#====================================================================<br><br># compile into nimble<br>Cmodel &lt;- compileNimble(model)<br></div><div><br></div><div>And here is the error I get when compiling my model: </div><div><span aria-label="Console Output" role="document" style="font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.1;color:rgb(0,0,0)"><span role="document" style="outline:none"><span style="color:rgb(197,6,11)">Error: In sizeAssignAfterRecursing: &#39;rpen&#39; is not available or its output type is unknown.
